      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاقَتَهُ</span></b>  <i>He hated him</i> [or <i>hated him in the
utmost degree</i>] <i>reciprocally, on account of some foul,</i>
or <i>evil, affair.</i> (A.) ― 
